{"name": "Linksider", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLinksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side effects</h2>The core mechanic are the <strong>\"Side Effects\"</strong> you attach to the sides of your character.<br/>These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels.<br/>By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Head-scratching puzzles</h2>Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse levels</h2>The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award-winning</h2>Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>", "short_desc": "Linksider is puzzle platfomer where you can attach different \"Side Effects\" to the sides of your character. Utilize these effects creatively and you may discover surprising interactions between them to help you solve various puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/header.jpg?t=1